GIT HUB :

Refresh $ git pull

Add things $ git add -A

And then commit it with $ git commit -m "text"

Then put it online $ git push

To verify things $ git status

Git committing text example : $ git commit -m "Added the simulation1 version2 - still missing to code the way we retrieve information for analysis and to code the muon energy spectrum for the particle gun"
